            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:1",
            "text": "Having a personal plot to grow fresh and pesticide-free vegetables has long been a dream for urban residents. What was once a getaway particularly for retirees is even becoming a desirable way for young citizens to escape the busy urban life, step into the farmland and fully bury themselves in the labor of farming."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:2",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:2",
            "text": "Nowadays, this dream has been turned into reality with the rise of “shared farms”, a concept that has exploded in popularity across a host of cities throughout China in recent years."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:3",
            "text": "The term refers to a practice where rural landowners rent out their unused plots to urban residents and provide professional assistance to help them cultivate and manage crops. In return, urban residents assume the daily responsibilities of sowing seeds and caring for the crops, ultimately harvesting the produce for their own consumption."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:4",
            "text": "Through shared farms, participants can gain access to both material and spiritual abundance. Beyond individual satisfaction, this model holds far greater significance. As agricultural culture integrates with modern life, shared farms also boost consumption and narrow the urban-rural gap, thus facilitating rural revitalization."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:5",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:5",
            "text": "By fulfilling people’s deeper and more essential needs, brand-new consumption settings and innovative business models are opened up, rooted in the pursuit of sustainable development."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:6",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-shandong-taian-2026-04-second-round-test:grammar-fill:6",
            "text": "Today, organic living has evolved into a lifestyle philosophy, connecting urban people with nature and promoting a more sustainable way of life."
          }
        ],
